# Optional. The console is fully functional without it: every rule, every
# finding, the space map, all presets, the permalink and the CSV work with this
# unset. The key buys one thing only — translating a sentence into a rule object
# that lands in the builder unrun.
#
# Unset  -> POST /api/translate returns 501 and points at the rule builder.
# Invalid -> 502.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
